{"id":"404345cb6603a5c9","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-independent-order-embedding.md","title":"独立列编码可计算偏序的度嵌入","display":"lem-independent-order-embedding — 独立列编码可计算偏序的度嵌入","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-independent-order-embedding","aliases":["20-lem-independent-order-embedding"],"display":"lem-independent-order-embedding — 独立列编码可计算偏序的度嵌入","chapter":"6","section":"6.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.1.6；Exercise 7.3.6(ii)","source_printed_pages":[134,155],"source_pdf_pages":[168,189],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable-independence]]","[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","[[20-df-degle]]","[[20-df-redeg]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-independent-order-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-independent-order-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-independent-order-embedding — 独立列编码可计算偏序的度嵌入"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.1.6；Exercise 7.3.6(ii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>134</span><span>155</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>168</span><span>189</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"96978d2a748174af\" href=\"?note=96978d2a748174af\" title=\"20-df-computable-independence\">20-df-computable-independence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_P\\ \\subseteq\\omega^2\">\\(\\preceq_P\\ \\subseteq\\omega^2\\)</span> 为偏序，成员关系全可计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompIndependent}(\\vec A)\">\\(\\operatorname{CompIndependent}(\\vec A)\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_n:=\\{\\langle j,x\\rangle:j\\preceq_P n\\land x\\in A_j\\}\">\\(X_n:=\\{\\langle j,x\\rangle:j\\preceq_P n\\land x\\in A_j\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n):=\\deg_T(X_n)\">\\(f(n):=\\deg_T(X_n)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 为 c.e. 度族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"96978d2a748174af\" href=\"?note=96978d2a748174af\" title=\"20-df-computable-independence\">20-df-computable-independence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}independent\\text{-}order\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall n,m\\ [n\\preceq_Pm\\Longleftrightarrow f(n)\\le f(m)],\\\\\n\\bigoplus_jA_j\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\Rightarrow\\forall n\\ [f(n)\\le\\mathbf0&#39;],\\\\\n\\operatorname{UniformCE}(\\vec A)\\Rightarrow\\forall n\\ [f(n)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}independent\\text{-}order\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall n,m\\ [n\\preceq_Pm\\Longleftrightarrow f(n)\\le f(m)],\\\\\n\\bigoplus_jA_j\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\Rightarrow\\forall n\\ [f(n)\\le\\mathbf0&#39;],\\\\\n\\operatorname{UniformCE}(\\vec A)\\Rightarrow\\forall n\\ [f(n)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\preceq_Pm\">\\(n\\preceq_Pm\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的下集包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的下集。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_n\">\\(X_n\\)</span> 的某位，先可计算地判定其列号是否 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_P n\">\\(\\preceq_P n\\)</span>，否则答否；若是则询问 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_m\">\\(X_m\\)</span>。反向若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\not\\preceq_Pm\">\\(n\\not\\preceq_Pm\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_m\">\\(X_m\\)</span> 只使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 以外的列，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_m\\le_TJ_{\\ne n}(\\vec A)\">\\(X_m\\le_TJ_{\\ne n}(\\vec A)\\)</span>。自反性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_n\\le_TX_n\">\\(A_n\\le_TX_n\\)</span>；于是若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_n\\le_TX_m\">\\(X_n\\le_TX_m\\)</span> 将违背独立性。反对称性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 单射。</p>\n<p>整体 join 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&#39;\">\\(0&#39;\\)</span> 下时，按可计算列筛选得到每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_n\\le_T0&#39;\">\\(X_n\\le_T0&#39;\\)</span>。统一 c.e. 情况下则在枚举矩阵时按可计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_P n\">\\(\\preceq_P n\\)</span> 筛选，给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_n\">\\(X_n\\)</span> 的 c.e. 枚举。分别结合两种独立序列可得到可计算偏序嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&#39;\">\\(0&#39;\\)</span> 以下或 c.e. 度结构。这里陈述的是有效给定偏序的版本；要扩到任意可数偏序，还需另证原书 Exercise 6.1.5 的可计算普适偏序。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 6.1.6；Exercise 7.3.6(ii)；印刷页 134, 155；PDF 第 168, 189 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable-independence","status":"resolved","id":"96978d2a748174af","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-independence]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc75264a5ecdc3fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-degle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-independence","status":"resolved","id":"96978d2a748174af","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc75264a5ecdc3fb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\preceq_P\\ \\subseteq\\omega^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CompIndependent}(\\vec A)","display":false},{"tex":"X_n:=\\{\\langle j,x\\rangle:j\\preceq_P n\\land x\\in A_j\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f(n):=\\deg_T(X_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}independent\\text{-}order\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall n,m\\ [n\\preceq_Pm\\Longleftrightarrow f(n)\\le f(m)],\\\\\n\\bigoplus_jA_j\\le_T\\varnothing'\\Rightarrow\\forall n\\ [f(n)\\le\\mathbf0'],\\\\\n\\operatorname{UniformCE}(\\vec A)\\Rightarrow\\forall n\\ [f(n)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"n\\preceq_Pm","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"X_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq_P n","display":false},{"tex":"X_m","display":false},{"tex":"n\\not\\preceq_Pm","display":false},{"tex":"X_m","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"X_m\\le_TJ_{\\ne n}(\\vec A)","display":false},{"tex":"A_n\\le_TX_n","display":false},{"tex":"X_n\\le_TX_m","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"0'","display":false},{"tex":"X_n\\le_T0'","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq_P n","display":false},{"tex":"X_n","display":false},{"tex":"0'","display":false}],"bytes":2459,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["96978d2a748174af","fc75264a5ecdc3fb","e888141c21b61ce5","f389bdba28de0478","e343870c773cb68e"]}